WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:03.694
Toad raced the horse across the meadow.

2
00:00:03.695 --> 00:00:06.904
Before long, the horse tired.

3
00:00:06.905 --> 00:00:10.005
Toad didn’t mind slowing down.

4
00:00:10.006 --> 00:00:14.977
"That awful possum is far behind," he said.

5
00:00:14.978 --> 00:00:18.849
After a few miles, the horse stopped.

6
00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:23.007
"Come on," said Toad, "keep going."

7
00:00:23.008 --> 00:00:27.764
But the horse lowered its head to eat grass.

8
00:00:27.765 --> 00:00:32.471
"I’m hungry too," thought Toad.

9
00:00:32.472 --> 00:00:35.894
Toad got off the horse and walked.

10
00:00:35.895 --> 00:00:39.614
Soon he came to a wide road.

11
00:00:39.615 --> 00:00:43.024
"I don’t know which direction to go.

12
00:00:43.025 --> 00:00:47.804
I hope someone comes by," he said.

13
00:00:47.805 --> 00:00:52.809
Far down the road, Toad heard a noise.

14
00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:57.941
It sounded like a faint vroom, vroom!

15
00:00:57.942 --> 00:01:01.060
A cloud of dust came toward him.

16
00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:04.840
"It’s a car!" yelled Toad.

17
00:01:04.841 --> 00:01:07.672
Toad jumped up and down.

18
00:01:07.673 --> 00:01:10.874
"Hooray!" he said.

19
00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:13.695
"I’ll ask them for a ride.

20
00:01:13.696 --> 00:01:17.660
Badger will be very surprised."

21
00:01:17.661 --> 00:01:20.856
He stepped into the road and waved.

22
00:01:20.857 --> 00:01:24.048
The car slowed down.

23
00:01:24.049 --> 00:01:27.892
Suddenly Toad’s knees shook.

24
00:01:27.893 --> 00:01:31.139
"Oh no!" cried Toad.

25
00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:34.952
It was the car from The Red Lion!

26
00:01:34.953 --> 00:01:38.674
"It’s the car I stole!" cried Toad.

27
00:01:38.675 --> 00:01:42.559
"It’s all over! Back to prison for me!

28
00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:46.454
I’ll be in chains!"

29
00:01:46.455 --> 00:01:50.717
Toad fainted and fell in the road.

30
00:01:50.718 --> 00:01:53.576
The car came near and stopped.

31
00:01:53.577 --> 00:01:57.842
"Oh dear! How sad!" said the driver.

32
00:01:57.843 --> 00:02:02.215
"It’s a poor old washwoman."

